  "html": "\n<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a><header class=\"wg-site-header\"><div class=\"wg-nav-inner\"><a aria-label=\"Wishly Guide home\" class=\"wg-brand\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"wg-brand-mark\">✦</span><span class=\"wg-brand-copy\"><b>Wishly <i>Guide</i></b><small>IDEAS FOR MEANINGFUL MOMENTS</small></span></a><div class=\"wg-nav-content\" id=\"wg-nav-content\"><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"wg-primary-nav\" id=\"wg-primary-nav\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/guides/\">Guides</a><a href=\"/topics/\">Topics</a><a href=\"/about/\">About</a><a href=\"/authors/ra-fahim/\">Developer</a><a href=\"/faq/\">FAQ</a></nav><div class=\"wg-nav-actions\"><div class=\"wg-nav-languages\"><a class=\"wg-lang-link\" href=\"/\" lang=\"en\">EN</a><a class=\"wg-lang-link\" href=\"/bn/\" lang=\"bn\">বাংলা</a></div><a class=\"wg-visit-link\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Visit Wishly <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div><button aria-controls=\"wg-nav-content\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" class=\"wg-menu-toggle\" type=\"button\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div></header><button aria-label=\"Close navigation menu\" class=\"wg-nav-scrim\" hidden=\"\" type=\"button\"></button><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div class=\"breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span>›</span><span>Developer</span></div><span class=\"eyebrow\">FOUNDER &amp; DEVELOPER</span><h1>Meet <em>RA Fahim.</em></h1><p>Web developer and creator building modern websites, web applications, SaaS products, e-commerce platforms and practical digital products.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"page-body author-page\"><div class=\"container author-profile-grid\"><figure class=\"author-profile-photo\"><img alt=\"RA Fahim — Web Developer and Creator, Founder of Wishly\" height=\"540\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/assets/editorial/ra-fahim-developer-wishly.webp\" width=\"540\"/ decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>RA Fahim · Web Developer &amp; Creator</figcaption></figure><div class=\"author-profile-copy\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">ABOUT THE CREATOR</p><h2>Building useful experiences for the web.</h2><p>RA Fahim is a web developer and creator from Bangladesh and the founder and developer behind Wishly. His work focuses on modern websites, web applications, SaaS products, e-commerce platforms and practical digital products.</p><p>He created Wishly to help people turn birthdays, proposals, anniversaries, apologies, invitations and personal messages into digital experiences they can customize and share through one link—without needing to write code.</p><p>Wishly launched on October 10. Its goal is to make personal website creation approachable while giving each creator room to make a page feel like their own.</p><div class=\"author-profile-actions\"><a class=\"premium-button\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Explore Wishly ↗</a><a class=\"premium-button premium-button-ghost\" href=\"https://rafahim.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Visit portfolio ↗</a></div><div class=\"author-social-links\"><a href=\"https://github.com/rafahimn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub ↗</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/rafahimn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook ↗</a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/rafahimn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram ↗</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">FROM THE BUILDER</p><h2>Read the story behind <em>Wishly.</em></h2><p>Learn about the idea, the product and the person building it.</p></div></div><div class=\"guide-grid\"><a class=\"guide-card\" href=\"/guides/ra-fahim-developer-behind-wishly/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"RA Fahim, developer and creator behind Wishly\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/ra-fahim-developer-wishly.webp\" width=\"540\"/ decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Founder story</span><h3>Meet RA Fahim: The Developer and Creator Behind Wishly</h3><p>The idea behind Wishly and the work of building a personal website maker.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>Read the profile</span><span>Read story ↗</span></div></div></a></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"wg-footer\"><div class=\"wg-footer-top\"><div class=\"wg-footer-brand\"><a class=\"wg-brand wg-footer-logo\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"wg-brand-mark\">✦</span><span class=\"wg-brand-copy\"><b>Wishly <i>Guide</i></b><small>IDEAS FOR MEANINGFUL MOMENTS</small></span></a><p>Thoughtful ideas, practical relationship guidance and creative inspiration for love, friendship, family and every moment worth remembering.</p><a class=\"wg-footer-visit\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Visit the main Wishly website ↗</a></div><div class=\"wg-footer-col\"><h2>Explore</h2><a href=\"/guides/\">All guides</a><a href=\"/video-guides/\">Video guides</a><a href=\"/topics/\">Browse topics</a><a href=\"/faq/\">Frequently asked questions</a><a href=\"/about/\">About this publication</a></div><div class=\"wg-footer-col\"><h2>Popular topics</h2><a href=\"/topics/love-and-romance/\">Love &amp; romance</a><a href=\"/topics/emotional-support/\">Emotional wellbeing</a><a href=\"/topics/communication-and-repair/\">Communication &amp; repair</a><a href=\"/topics/long-distance-relationships/\">Long-distance relationships</a><a href=\"/topics/friendship-and-gratitude/\">Friendship &amp; gratitude</a><a href=\"/topics/special-occasions/\">Special occasions</a><a href=\"/topics/personal-messages-and-ai/\">Messages &amp; AI writing</a></div><div class=\"wg-footer-col\"><h2>Publication</h2><a href=\"/authors/ra-fahim/\">Meet the developer</a><